  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT2
    value: 3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES_1
    value: LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_TITLE_1
    value: WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: Appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols except        ,       
      and       .
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_TITLE_2
    value: SCATTER
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: 3 Scatter Symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers <style=coinColor>LUCKY
      COIN FREE GAMES</style>.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: GOLDEN TICKET FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '- <indent=1em>Each time player gets       anywhere on reels, it will
      be collected at the progression bar above the reels.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Once
      all       are collected, <style=coinColor>OUTBACK BEAUTY FREE GAMES</style>
      is triggered.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Special Symbol        can appear
      anywhere on reels and when it lands on a reel,           consumes one      
      from the progression bar, triggering <style=coinColor>SLOT-IN-SLOT FEATURE</style>.</indent>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: "SLOT-IN-SLOT FEATURE\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: "SLOT-IN-SLOT FEATURE\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: LUCKY COIN FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_5
    value: OUTBACK BEAUTY FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "- During Base Game,         consumes one          from the progression
      bar and triggers <style=coinColor>Slot-in-Slot \n  Feature</style>.\n- Once
      triggered, it reveals 3x3 mini slot with 1 pay-line."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "- Scatter Symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers Lucky Coin Free Games.\n-
      There is no progression during <style=coinColor>Lucky Coin Free Games</style>,
      meaning that there is NO Slot-in-Slot \n  Feature.\n- There is a Golden Sub-symbol
      in Lucky Coin Free Games and it can appear with any symbol.\n- Each spin, the
      number of Golden Sub-symbols determines the prize.\n- Retrigger is possible."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- Fully filled progression bar during Base Game triggers Outback Beauty
      Free Games.\n- During <style=coinColor>Outback Beauty Free Games</style>, game
      starts with Progression Bar already fully filled with \n  12 Collectibles.\n-
      Every spin, one          is deducted but player can collect          from the
      reels and game continues\n  until the progression bar is empty. \n- Slot-in-Slot
      Feature is available as in Base Game.\n- Golden Sub-Symbols appear as in Lucky
      Coin Free Games."
